he Athletic Facility. Minimum Qualifications (or equivalent combination of education and experience) High school diploma and one year of related experience required. Valid driver’s license or ability to obtain, and driver’s check may be required. Ability to occasionally lift up to 100 lbs and push/pull up to 80 lbs. may be required. Specific physical requirements may apply based on specific job functions. Initial employment is contingent upon successful completion of physical screening. Desirable Qualifications Anticipated Pay Range $20.25 - $22.12/hr Other Information Bargaining Unit Position – United Electrical Workers, A probationary period may be required, Background Check required for this position Special Conditions Weekend work required, Occasional evening and/or weekends required (if non-exempt position, may result in overtime), 2nd Shift (Shift differential applies.), Background Check required for this position FLSA Non-Exempt Union Position Yes, UE ($18.50 minimum hourly rate) Posting Details Position will be posted for a minimum of one week, after which it is subject to removal without notice. Job Location Burlington, Vermont, United States Job Open Date 09/25/2026 Job Close Date (Jobs close at 11:59 PM EST.) Open Until Filled No Our Common Ground Statement The University of Vermont is a welcoming, educationally purposeful community committed to creating an inclusive environment that embraces intellectual diversity and global perspectives. We seek to prepare students to be accountable leaders who will bring to their work a grasp of complexity, effective problem-solving and communication skills, and an enduring commitment to learning and ethical conduct. Members of the University of Vermont community embrace and advance the values of Our Common Ground: Respect, Integrity, Innovation, Openness, Justice, and Responsibility. Staff play a critical role in this effort and the successful candidate will demonstrate a strong commitment to UVM’s mission and advancing Our Common Ground values through the execution of their job duties. Position Information Position Title Fac Mgmt & Services OC4 N Posting Number S6321PO Department Athletics/30500 Position Number 007410 Percent of Full-Time 1.00 Standard Hours at 1.0 FTE 40 Term (months per year) 12 Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume Optional Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application ©2019 The University of Vermont – Burlington, VT 05405 – (802) 656-3131 To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
